  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>欢迎亲爱的幸存者们。</strong></span> <br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否玩过<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">变异兽模组</a>，并且对那些绿色丑陋的变异僵尸感到厌倦？</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你喜欢我的资源包<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-18\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Tissou的僵尸包</strong></a>，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">那么这个就是为你准备的！</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>才能运行，我为你提供全新的游戏内视觉体验——变异僵尸。通过<strong>超过30个新材质</strong>，TZP Plus基于由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chumbanotz </a>和主要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">shcott21</span></a>创建的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">变异兽模组</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/988657970063765554/2022-06-21_05.19.36.png\" alt=\"Pic1\" width=\"926\" height=\"521\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">请记住，你需要<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Optifine</strong></a>以及显然需要的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">变异兽</a>模组，才能充分利用我的材质包 😄</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/988657970520948786/2022-06-21_05.20.23.png\" alt=\"pic2\" width=\"918\" height=\"516\"></span>再次强调，我要完全归功于<span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chumbanotz</a>，他基于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\" rel=\"nofollow\">shcott21</a>的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">变异生物</a>重新创造了这个惊人的模组。</span><br><br><em>请勿窃取，请保留署名。😊</em></span></p>",
